  "description": {
    "text": "The reward pack (奖赏包) is the one-card prize for the winner in the Happy Set Lucario & Greninja & Zamazenta & Mabosstiff of 16 May 2025. It holds one of 14 holos: one of the eight basic Energy, in 87.5% of packs, or one of six Pokémon, in 12.5%: Fidough, Dachsbun, Greavard, Houndstone, Maschiff and Mabosstiff. The six Pokémon are numbered out of 6.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: More on Fearless Terastal, and the new Happy Set (18 April 2025)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15514.html"
      }
    ]
  },
